<title>USA: Churchill Downs Inc annual, special divs.</title>
<headline>Churchill Downs Inc annual, special divs.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Churchill Downs Inc set a regular annual dividend of $0.50 per share and a special dividend of $0.15 per share on its common stock.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable January 10 1997 to stockholders of record as of December 31 1996.</p>
<p>The annual dividend is unchanged from the previous dividend of $0.50.</p>
</text>
